        "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a202cc-e750-7202-a418-731effe8ebbf -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 History skips deliveries tied at a page boundary\n\nHistory sorts by `scheduled_at` and `id`, but its cursor filters only for earlier timestamps.\n\nWhen a page ends partway through a shared timestamp, subsequent pages omit the remaining deliveries at that timestamp.\n\nEncode both `scheduled_at` and `id` in the cursor and resume with a strict lexicographic comparison on that pair.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a202a0-cd61-7684-99bc-53c775b0de50/reviews/01a202cb-e36b-7316-8580-bd034d371763/findings/01a202cc-e753-776d-970f-ceb4303052f1)",
